BT /F1 11 Tf 45.0 817.0 Td (Interpretation and validation notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45.0 792.0 Td (Why linear probing degrades near a full table) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 775.0 Td (Collisions create primary clusters: consecutive occupied cells attract later keys whose) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 762.0 Td (home cells fall inside or before a cluster. As alpha rises, these runs grow, so misses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 749.0 Td (must scan farther before reaching an empty cell. Expected miss cost is) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 736.0 Td (0.5*\(1+1/\(1-alpha\)^2\), which grows sharply as alpha approaches 1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 711.0 Td (At alpha=0.9, linear probing measured 36.086 miss cells \(50.500 theory\) and 6.060) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 698.0 Td (successful cells \(5.500 theory\); chaining measured 0.892 miss nodes. The 5,000 misses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 685.0 Td (sample one finite table, so its cluster layout need not equal the theoretical average.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45.0 650.0 Td (Agent errors and how they were caught) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 632.0 Td (1. A server test initially expected a collision from a URL pair that did not share a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 619.0 Td (   home bucket at capacity 101. The missing chain arrow revealed it; checking the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 606.0 Td (   actual Horner indices identified a matching pair, and the test passed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 580.0 Td (2. I first conflated localhost success with public Codespaces availability. A separate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 567.0 Td (   forwarded-URL check returned 404 while localhost returned 200, and the Ports panel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 45.0 554.0 Td (   had no forwarded entry. Checking both endpoints separately caught the mistake.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7 Tf 45.0 30.0 Td (Repository: https://github.com/jiwon5042/algori_hw2) Tj ET

